/**
 * @file http3_msh3_client
 * @brief Bounded synchronous HTTP/3 client for the msh3/MsQuic backend.
 *
 * This optional user-mode header requires msh3.h and a target that links
 * msh3. The system-trust client delegates certificate validation to MsQuic.
 * The private-CA client receives the peer certificate and applies an exact
 * application-owned CA, DNS-name, and server-auth policy. Deliberately no
 * certificate-validation bypass is exposed by this API.
 *
 * @copyright Copyright (c) 2022 NT Template Library Authors.
 */
